script: Array.from(new Intl.Segmenter("en", { granularity: "word" }).segment("a'\u0308A"), function (s) { return s.isWordLike ? "Y" : "N"; }).join("")
note: WordBreakTest.txt line 1422's segments. The owner's word status (row G4), out and both engines' plans: Broiler.VM's JSD-0074 (X2, G4), Broiler.JS's docs/roadmap/SharedLibraries.md record of SJL-7.1
since: 18

